\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid9899110\charrsid9899110  }{\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid9899110\charrsid9899110 In the given situations what types of merger is suitable for each situation and  why?
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f1\insrsid9899110\charrsid9899110 \loch\af1\dbch\af0\hich\f1 \'b7\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\tx720\faauto\ls1\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid9899110\charrsid9899110 McDonald\rquote s with KFC
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f1\insrsid9899110\charrsid9899110 \loch\af1\dbch\af0\hich\f1 \'b7\tab}One steel mill with another steel mill
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f1\insrsid9899110\charrsid9899110 \loch\af1\dbch\af0\hich\f1 \'b7\tab}ABN AMRO with Royal bank of Scotland 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f1\insrsid9899110\charrsid9899110 \loch\af1\dbch\af0\hich\f1 \'b7\tab}Steel mill with a fertilizer producing firm
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f1\insrsid9899110\charrsid9899110 \loch\af1\dbch\af0\hich\f1 \'b7\tab}An oil cooking producing company with Desi Ghee producing company}{\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid9899110 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\tx720\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid8929592 {\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid8929592 
\par }{\b\f0\ul\cf0\ulc0\insrsid8929592\charrsid8929592 Answer:
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid9899110 
\par }{\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid8929592 McDonald\rquote s with KFC: }{\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid8929592 The merger in this case will be a }{\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid8929592\charrsid11037827 horizontal merger}{\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid8929592  because they both }{
\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid14418234 produce related products, which is the condition of horizontal merger.}{\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid8929592 
\par 
\par }{\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid8929592 One Steel Mill with other Steel Mill: }{\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid8929592 The two steel mills will }{\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid8929592\charrsid11037827 merge horizontally}{\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid8929592 
 because both the mills are producing similar product.
\par 
\par }{\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid8929592\charrsid8929592 ABN AMRO with Royal Bank of Scotland:}{\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid8929592  }{\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid8929592 Both the banks will }{\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid8929592\charrsid11037827 merge horizontally}{
\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid8929592  because both are providing similar type of services.
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\tx720\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid8929592 {\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid8929592 
\par }{\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid8929592\charrsid8929592 Steel mill with a fertilizer producing firm}{\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid8929592 : }{\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid11037827 Since both the firms are non-}{\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid8929592 interrelated so this merger will be a }{
\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid8929592\charrsid11037827 diversified merger.}{\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid8929592 
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\tx720\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid10318730 {\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid10318730 
\par }{\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid10318730\charrsid10318730 An oil cooking producing company with Desi Ghee producing company}{\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid14418234 : }{\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid11037827 The merger in this situation will be a }{
\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid11037827\charrsid11037827 production merger}{\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid11037827  }{\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid11037827 because production of both products is related but the products themselves are not competing.}{
\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid10318730\charrsid11037827 
